  "steps": [
    "Peel and finely grate the potatoes and carrots into a bowl.",
    "Add the flour, baking powder, milk, eggs, salt and pepper and mix into a smooth batter.",
    "Stir in the diced provola.",
    "Spread into a parchment-lined 30 × 26 cm tray.",
    "Slice the red onion very thinly (a mandoline helps) and lay it over the top.",
    "Sprinkle with the grated Parmesan.",
    "Bake at 180 °C for 35–40 minutes, until golden.",
    "Rest for 10 minutes before serving."
